    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CursorLubLub</strong> - Adore cute little monsters Get ready to meet a cute game that will melt your heart! \ud83d\udc96 In the world of CursorLubLub, you will play the role of a &quot;hand&quot; that must stroke the neck or gently poke the cute monsters to fall asleep &quot;comfortably&quot;. But be careful! Because some monsters may need more &quot;adoration&quot; than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Easy control system, just drag and tap to touch the monster <br>-There is a &quot;plus&quot; system that allows you to upgrade your hand to be stronger <br>-The images and sounds give a warm and relaxing feeling <br>-Suitable for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
